{'symbol': 'CEG', 'date': '2023-01-30 16:30:00', 'title': 'QUAKER HOUGHTON SUPPORTS CLEAN ENERGY WITH CONSTELLATION ADVANCING ITS GOAL OF ACHIEVING CARBON NEUTRALITY', 'text': 'CONSHOHOCKEN, PA. , JAN. 30, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- QUAKER HOUGHTON (NYSE: KWR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A CONTRACT WITH CONSTELLATION TO PURCHASE RENEWABLE ENERGY CERTIFICATES ("RECS") TO MATCH APPROXIMATELY HALF OF ITS TOTAL U.S. BASED ELECTRICITY NEEDS.'}